#: templates/mpts.html:443
msgid "What is an MPT?"
msgstr ""

#: templates/mpts.html:445
msgid ""
"A Multi-Purpose Token (MPT) is a newer XRPL primitive for issuing tokens "
"directly on the ledger. Unlike trust-line IOUs, MPTs carry a structured "
"metadata blob — name, ticker, description, asset class, issuer info, "
"audit links — that is signed by the issuer and stored on-chain. Built for"
" institutional issuance: tokenized funds, stablecoins, loyalty tokens."
msgstr ""

#: templates/mpts.html:448
msgid "Honest note on classification."
msgstr ""

#: templates/mpts.html:449
msgid ""
"We classify each MPT by reading its asset_class field per XLS-89 and "
"normalizing. Issuers self-declare — when an issuer leaves the field blank"
" or uses a non-standard value, we put it in \"Other\"."
msgstr ""

