#: templates/pools.html:464
msgid ""
"Think of it like a vending machine for swapping two tokens. Anyone can "
"drop both tokens in (this is called 'providing liquidity') and earn a "
"small fee every time someone uses it to swap. The price you get depends "
"on how much of each token is sitting in the pool. TVL is the total dollar"
" value parked inside it right now."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pools.html:467
msgid ""
"Every AMM pool we've indexed from the XRP Ledger, ranked by total value "
"locked. XRP-paired pools are sized in USD using the XRP price; pools with"
