msgid ""
"We only count pools where one side is XRP, because XRP has a live, well-"
"known dollar price we can trust. Pools that pair two other tokens (like "
"RLUSD with USDC) are harder to price honestly — we'd be guessing — so "
"they don't count toward this headline number."
