"Three kinds of moves get listed here: (1) really big XRP transfers (the "
"size cutoff is set just below), (2) anything touching a wallet we "
"recognize — exchanges, big projects, public companies — that's also above"
" the same size cutoff (token amounts get priced into XRP first), and (3) "
"when one of those recognized wallets opens a trustline to a brand-new "
"token (no size filter — opening a trustline is the signal itself)."
