"'whale' size — rare and almost always worth knowing about. 100K is a good"
" default for catching coordinated activity. 50K shows everything we "
"track, useful on quiet days. Recognized-wallet moves are held to the same"
" size cutoff (token amounts get priced into XRP first); only new-"
"trustline events bypass it."
